FOV

Here is a simple FOV calculator I made in google sheets.  The values are currently set for a 32 inch triple monitor, but if you want to modify for you specific monitors then you can access the actual spreadsheet [here ](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1ZjP1nyIdkpgue6rNBKzN6w-oEYRrY5UOKsdcb_42I4Q/edit?usp=sharing)and then save a copy of it to allow you to edit it.

